{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:42cd4b7f9fc31823e26a7eebc7092ea923beaa31d19239f18bff30a39bf62acb",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2962bd03062b0429e40949230abdadb4b4aee699bca0154025e19c7e2a17b3ee",
      "text": "庆祝就要靠惊喜！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d83ed68026d9e08487639704d0516c618b12f47b939f05be78999231efc87b72",
      "text": "隼人的生日快到了，\n四季等人策划了一场惊喜派对。\n大家背着隼人迅速展开准备，\n但他察觉到成员们的举止有些反常，\n不禁感到有些疑惑……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8027e39e7ef9b6472ce65402105d04faca341ccc8f767229443c2cc99354e69",
      "text": "终于到了这一天啦……！我都一直在提心吊胆，\n生怕自己不小心对隼人亲说漏嘴了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1290c5ae97d2eacf52173c05d583cebe2c3a4962017f937cb382ddfce6edc442",
      "text": "嗯……我也是。\n隼人要是能高兴就好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4715ac178a43b4208b8c27772205af49e94adce2f1a70354fe9d9c260e6f912d",
      "text": "说什么呢，\n他肯定会超高兴的啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5499dfce50dcb4df38c9279f3272362fbdc383a002fc68b69909d8684f698f34",
      "text": "是啊，那是毫无疑问的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e685838d25036795b951666173f5e2b1f267bc48a9817f4a73fc629f098ba426",
      "text": "（在学校碰见他的时候，\n他就已经飘飘然的了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fb85e6232a501ab786aff56157ad1c317650d544a83fb254c229bff398364cd",
      "text": "啊啊～感觉时间过得好慢啊！\n隼人亲怎么还不快点来啊～！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfda7b909b571cdc260ecb96fd23faea4624551338ca4dd88009fe3e15a26899",
      "text": "呜……呜呜……\n真的太谢谢你们了，大家……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b6304d1848cead88f253b4001b1fb7b305552aa713acb8245819c84d0ba1ca5",
      "text": "心意我们领了，\n但你哭得有点太厉害了哦，隼人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d775ccaf7751b6dc87aac44cf79deedc9474528d6b39d0b7c241a7ad904ef71f",
      "text": "我知道啦……\n可是，我真的太高兴了嘛……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f00ce88bde3eeb76bcdf35642edc76bb5f42cd48b931db30dc732cd6ae6ea122",
      "text": "一想到大家为了我做到这种地步，\n心里就一下子热乎乎的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a22ac3c2cdae5911492f1d64e5222d54da396ccfa22fc2ba42e17a190e6f0cd",
      "text": "然后眼泪就停不下来了……\n呜……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aee0a0d952d9bbf48c52a77cfdc3c6a33c46436bcad8c51e40981bf45e4e7c47",
      "text": "能让你这么高兴的话，\n那大家的准备也就没有白费呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d7616fd1382543af6b046298462c870a3a940f5b3080077ad938b93b9fec696",
      "text": "事务所装饰得好厉害啊！\n弄起来很辛苦吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1c289fdc3b63cb2150214abab6c3e293399b9648839e4e86ed0aec132a9c91a",
      "text": "白板上的留言也是……\n我超级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e515dc6c2886dbc655cd4d6a15fd1edc7d6a296ec70d3c9f0626b3188e8ae97",
      "text": "……四季他们，\n很努力地在准备……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87e7fe28ede42c4e277973818c33e63915beadc31d1e5f02c7d7434c6ca07e86",
      "text": "夏来也帮忙了吧。\n谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1a689eb0bbf7fb103bab9d884ff3cdd78e2ce334a9a918902065d9cc38dd622",
      "text": "……道谢什么的，不用啦。因为我也……\n想让隼人……高高兴兴的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_d:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e2dd214e604527883a2617c0ba524ce6594b4e4c4995eb4f271b5527c6fd6f3",
      "text": "不仅有大家的祝福，\n还有蛋糕和礼物……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:198c26df573827ded4d0076fc27214878f66ac58f3e439e331e7f3a4ffbc9ec0",
      "text": "让我收下这么多、各种各样的东西，\n真的好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac5b32189e00c4b65b41561efe9f6af2d1e6b32414c52e1a17f9b3bcb0cc8523",
      "text": "那不是理所当然的嘛！毕竟是一年一度的生日啊。\n而且，要给你的东西还没完呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bf22e27c0437e19681631d1521aa387424633e4c4736848ee0a9310c654062f",
      "text": "这是我特别送给你的……生日甜甜圈！\n带回家去吃吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55ce8f452480bb4c5c2f28ce8c8a28801ec0716fbf09d20db05ca72abca2a451",
      "text": "哇，看起来好好吃……每一颗我都会好好品尝的。\n谢谢你，春名！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99d316d124076aaa11c58721f8ecd2da46be2eb77021861737f17683bf9c948c",
      "text": "真的非常感谢你\n帮我庆祝，四季。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:749e628e638d94b25f7475ed6edc589e7d148824520b50410917ca40b93ae170",
      "text": "不用客气啦！今天好好庆祝一整天，\n明天还要风风火火地办后夜祭呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01d7c0f9bfe0028a52c7dccc1571c79da68ceeaa8103c6ca1c18ab7553d2c004",
      "text": "那明天就去唱卡拉OK吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25ce628b99d832e73b66d4f6932181e2ec7bd093a4403c666f9f23d9d2b854ae",
      "text": "话说……生日派对会有\n后夜祭这种东西吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_020hay_2_1_2_020_12:1_2_020_12_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4282ff04d466789711f661014185965f9278ed00a4a6a3517fddc1b8c30aad9",
      "text": "说什么呢！喜事不管庆祝多少次\n都是理所当然的啦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
